{"id":63293,"mal_id":63293,"title":"Hotaru no Yomeiri","englishTitle":"Firefly Wedding","title_english":"Firefly Wedding","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Firefly Wedding","ja":"ホタルの嫁入り"},"synopsis":"Satoko, the eldest daughter of the honorable Kirigaya family, has received many marriage proposals from men captivated by her beauty and grace. However, she has turned them all down due to her secret heart defect. Despite her condition, Satoko is still willing to find a husband to ease her beloved father's concerns.\n\nWhile on a stroll, Satoko is kidnapped by a group of mercenaries, one of them being Shinpei Gotou—a legendary assassin tasked with executing her. Satoko tries to bribe Gotou into freeing her, but it proves unsuccessful. Out of options, Satoko makes a desperate gamble: under the pretense of love at first sight, she asks him to marry her.\n\nUnexpectedly, Gotou takes the bait and vows to protect her. As the couple escapes to freedom, Satoko struggles to keep up the ruse and make sense of the mysterious man she has eloped with.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Satoko, la hija mayor de la honorable familia Kirigaya, ha recibido muchas propuestas de matrimonio de hombres cautivados por su belleza y gracia. Sin embargo, ella los rechazó todos debido a su defecto cardíaco secreto. A pesar de su condición, Satoko todavía está dispuesta a encontrar un marido que alivie las preocupaciones de su amado padre.\n\nDurante un paseo, Satoko es secuestrada por un grupo de mercenarios, uno de ellos Shinpei Gotou, un asesino legendario encargado de ejecutarla. Satoko intenta sobornar a Gotou para que la libere, pero no tiene éxito. Sin opciones, Satoko hace una apuesta desesperada: bajo el pretexto de amor a primera vista, le pide que se case con ella.\n\nInesperadamente, Gotou muerde el anzuelo y promete protegerla. Mientras la pareja escapa hacia la libertad, Satoko lucha por mantener la artimaña y encontrarle sentido al misterioso hombre con el que se ha fugado.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"currently_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1375,"average_episode_duration":1375,"startDate":"2026-10-09","start_date":"2026-10-09","endDate":null,"end_date":null,"season":"fall","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"fall"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":7.73,"mean":7.73,"numListUsers":99494,"num_list_users":99494,"genres":[{"id":13,"name":"Historical"},{"id":22,"name":"Romance"}],"studios":[{"id":287,"name":"David Production"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3zmB6PLnjf7rNNC2lnvinQtlJMx.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jF0Y73x1pWq6noava9Cp900i8Tm.png","tmdb_id":"320909","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:49:23.001Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1172/159893.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1172/159893l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1172/159893.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1172/159893l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1172/159893l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"friday","time":"23:30","day_of_the_week":"friday","start_time":"23:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"friday 23:30"},"rank":1391,"popularity":2487,"rating":"r","num_scoring_users":10909,"nsfw":"white","source":"web_manga","background":"Hotaru no Yomeiri aired on Fuji TV's noitaminA block.","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":65157,"title":"Yumegokochi","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1547/160484.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1547/160484l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"other","relation_type_formatted":"Other"},{"node":{"id":65184,"title":"Hotaru no Yomeiri: Choitashi","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1277/160535.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1277/160535l.